reddening,system,*,both,given_by_other_source,0.1,,,fraction of E(B-V),,as_released,gc_reddening,,not_published,"Lützgendorf et al. 2013, A&A 552, A49 (arXiv 1212.3475v1)",l. 489,"""the average errors on … the reddening (10 %)"": L13's description of Harris (1996), not read at source, applied here to the 2010 edition; the kind of error is not stated. Moves R_Sun only, so g_obs ∝ 1/D and g_bar ∝ 1/D² (F1). Uses each cluster's x_gc_baumgardt_ebv_mag",
