integrated_magnitude,system,*,g_bar,given_by_other_source,,,,mag,x_gc_baumgardt_vt_scatter_mag,upper_bound,gc_luminosity_vt,,not_published,"Baumgardt, Sollima & Hilker 2020, PASA 37, e046 (arXiv 2009.09611v1)","paper.tex Table tab:comp, l. 266; l. 254","The ""standard deviation around the mean"" of the differences from Harris (2010). It bounds the Harris error from above only because BSH20 calls the estimates ""more or less independent of each other"" (l. 254). It excludes the mean offsets (+0.03, +0.01 and −0.25 mag); the −0.25 mag offset for V > 11 is a systematic shift this row does not carry. Moves g_bar only (F1)",
