ml_population,system,*,g_bar,given,,,,solMass / solLum,x_gc_baumgardt_ml_v_err,one_sigma,gc_ml_scale,,not_published,"McLaughlin & van der Marel 2005, ApJS 161, 304 (arXiv astro-ph/0605132v1; VizieR J/ApJS/161/304)","clusters VOT, e_(M/L)1: ""The 1{sigma} error in BC/ChD""","It mixes a dataset-scale age term (13 ± 2 Gyr for every cluster) with a system-scale [Fe/H] term (± 0.2 dex), not split by MvdM (F6). Labelling it system is a simplification. Already inside g_bar_err_lo/hi, so not added again. As a fraction for gc_ml_scale: x_gc_baumgardt_ml_v_err / x_gc_baumgardt_ml_v",yes
