stellar_ml,dataset,*,g_bar,given,,,,solMass / solLum,x_gc_baumgardt_ml_v_salpeter,range,gc_stellar_ml,,not_published,"McLaughlin & van der Marel 2005, ApJS 161, 304 (arXiv astro-ph/0605132v1; VizieR J/ApJS/161/304); Kruijssen & Mieske 2009 (arXiv 0903.4683)",registry gc_stellar_ml; D-039,"The registry range. Upper end: each cluster's Salpeter value, in the column. Lower end: 0.53 × x_gc_baumgardt_ml_v, from the registry's range_basis.min (Kruijssen & Mieske 2009; D-039), not from a column. MvdM's models build in about 30 % mass loss (MvdM Fig. 4); MvdM used Harris (1996) [Fe/H] (F8)",
